  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funding to Education Fund for Sindh Province (not for profit company) to provide quality primary education in Karachi and two districts in Sindh</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funding to Education Fund for Sindh Province (not for profit company) to provide quality primary education in Karachi and two districts in Sindh is a component of Education Fund for Sindh reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xa3;13,646,690. It works in the following sector(s): Primary education, Educational research, Teacher training.</narrative>
  </description>
